==English==

===Etymology===
From {{term|literate|lang=en}} + {{term|-cy|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlɪtəɹəsi/}}
* {{audio|en-us-literacy.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|literacies}}

# The [[ability]] to [[read]].
# [[understanding|Understanding]] of something (ex. [[computer]] literacy).

